     1652   end.
     1653   END.
     1654   ON ROW-DISPLAY OF Br-params IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1655   DO:
     1656     CASE tt-ext-file-par.param-type:
     1657       WHEN 'C':U THEN DO:
     1658         ASSIGN
     1659         tt-ext-file-par.param-name :bgcolor in browse Br-params = white_COLOR
